/**
 * Agent — unified orchestrator for Azure / OpenAI LLM providers.
 *
 * Holds the FSM run loop plus the helper cluster (planner-mode detection,
 * action nudges, message factories, circuit breaker, token budgeting). The
 * provider abstraction (see {@link LLMProvider}) owns wire-format conversion,
 * streaming, and tokenization.
 *
 * The unified loop sends a synthetic, ephemeral planner instruction on every
 * planner-mode turn. The first turn receives the planning directive; later
 * turns receive the continuation directive so tool-result follow-ups do not
 * drift back into planning/bookkeeping loops.
 *
 * See:
 *   - docs/agent-refactor-blueprint.md §3, §7
 *   - docs/agent-refactor-implementation-plan.md Phase 7
 */

